        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Pouh Raguang bam Jerusalem thanh khou,",
            "Thuankumei himdaihmei khuan rui padik ge;",
            "Kahim daihmei zan hei saanna bam khuan sini,",
            "Pak ri sini satang makge.",
            "",
            "Paak ri sini satang makge,",
            "Kaidai gaimei kaomei lam tei sana",
            "Paak ri sini ai satang ngam makge.",
            "",
            "2. Nthanmei nun le tingkauh banchra guai,",
            "Kaidai gaimei khou tei zaat guai kariuna,",
            "Aniu munpuang tuai kanmei puang patdat nimei,",
            "Paak ri sini satang makge.",
            "",
            "3. Zaat guai khou rui kasing phu ngam makmei,",
            "Tingmik thuih Lauziu Na Guangh bam dinghuamma,",
            "Kaidai khou gutmei bumaeng tei chak ngam lakge,",
            "Pak ri sini satang makge.",
            "",
            "4. Ringmei latrik khou zan hiloumei nun",
            "Kaniu khang gumeipurui bam chamdaanlou",
            "Gumeipu rui niu rianra ti zaengthaek louni",
            "Karam gaitei niu hou nithe."
          ]
        }
      }
